WEBVTT

00:02:28.728 --> 00:02:31.564
and some other well-known
climate activists.

00:02:31.564 --> 00:02:34.442
And there was a photo taken,
I think, of five of you,

00:02:34.483 --> 00:02:38.404
and the other four were white women,
white young women,

00:02:38.446 --> 00:02:39.822
you were all very young.

00:02:39.822 --> 00:02:41.741
And you were cut out of the photograph.

00:02:41.741 --> 00:02:42.950
VN: Yes.

00:02:42.992 --> 00:02:46.078
MR: You could have just, you know,
accepted that, but you didn’t.

00:02:46.078 --> 00:02:49.373
Tell us about why, how you felt

00:02:49.373 --> 00:02:53.419
and then why you decided
to react the way you did

00:02:53.461 --> 00:02:54.712
and what you did.

00:02:55.046 --> 00:02:59.884
VN: When I first saw the photograph,
I was, of course, really frustrated

00:02:59.926 --> 00:03:02.803
because I remember one of the messages